; Hollow Vale — the Street, grey-box. CLAUDE_CODE_BRIEF.md §4.1.
;
; PLACEHOLDER: every mesh here is a primitive with a flat colour. Replaced by
; the painted stylized 3D of GDD §10 and the licensed village/building sets of
; its "Asset sourcing plan".
;
; Palette is the Hollow Vale row of GDD §10 — ochre, dust, timber brown, flat
; overcast white, rust red on fences and the tower. Peacock blue and magenta
; are forbidden in this scene; the only exception in the whole slice is the
; Glimpse backlight and its feather, which arrive in P5.

